264
00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.606
Vidite njezin pristup?

265
00:17:16.626 --> 00:17:18.940
Da. to bi bilo nezaboravno.

266
00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.786
I nije li nam sam Wordsworth
rekao da se nijedan

267
00:17:21.806 --> 00:17:24.859
