kamenju. sklisko je.

329
00:21:47.973 --> 00:21:49.253
gospođice Bennet!

330
00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:51.560
gospođice Bennet!

331
00:21:52.499 --> 00:21:53.579
gospođice Bingley!

332
00:21:54.366 --> 00:21:56.440
- Gospođice Bing...
