- Odvedi je unutra.

347
00:22:49.032 --> 00:22:50.126
gospođice Bennet.

348
00:22:50.173 --> 00:22:51.880
Prepusti to meni. prepusti to meni.

349
00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:57.580
