00:25:26.900 --> 00:25:28.280
u redu

366
00:25:28.760 --> 00:25:30.760
On će se potpuno oporaviti.

367
00:25:33.026 --> 00:25:34.066
Hvala.

368
00:26:02.553 --> 00:26:03.840
Hvala.

